  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop CX 200 TOUR 16x19 2024 is a tour-level control racquet designed for advanced players seeking precision, feel and greater spin access than the 18x20 version. Its 95 sq.in head, 315 g unstrung weight and 315 mm slightly head-light balance provide exceptional stability and confidence on aggressive swings. SONIC CORE with Infinergy improves rebound and vibration absorption, VIBROSHIELD enhances comfort and feel, POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ supports spin and power, while CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY improves stability and swing-through.",

    "zh": "Dunlop CX 200 TOUR 16x19 2024 是一款高阶竞技控制型球拍，采用95平方英寸拍面、315克空拍重量、315毫米略偏头轻平衡及16×19线床。相比18×20版本，它在保持极高精准度与稳定性的同时，提供更好的旋转潜力和更灵活的击球弹道。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹与减震表现，VIBROSHIELD 改善舒适性与手感，POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ 增强旋转与力量，而 CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY 则进一步提升拍框稳定性与挥拍效率。非常适合高水平底线进攻及全场型球员。"
  },

